# Guia de instalação - GNU Radio 3.10, UHD e gr-tempest


```bash
/home/lucas/prefix-3.10-clean
```


---

## 1. Atualizar o sistema e instalar dependências base

```bash
sudo apt update
```

```bash
sudo apt install -y autoconf automake build-essential ccache cmake cpufrequtils doxygen ethtool g++ git inetutils-tools libboost-all-dev libncurses-dev libusb-1.0-0 libusb-1.0-0-dev python3-dev python3-mako python3-numpy python3-requests python3-scipy python3-setuptools python3-ruamel.yaml
```

```bash
sudo apt install libncurses-dev
```

Instalar dependências adicionais usadas na compilação do GNU Radio 3.10:

```bash
sudo apt install -y build-essential pkg-config libboost-all-dev pybind11-dev python3-pybind11 python3-dev python3-pip python3-click python3-click-plugins python3-zmq python3-packaging python3-pygccxml libfftw3-dev libgsm1-dev liborc-0.4-dev liblog4cpp5-dev libzmq3-dev libsndfile1-dev libcodec2-dev libgsm1-dev libusb-1.0-0-dev qtbase5-dev qttools5-dev qttools5-dev-tools pyqt5-dev-tools python3-pyqt5 libqwt-qt5-dev
```

Instalar dependências que foram necessárias para VOLK, spdlog, GMP e fmt:

```bash
sudo apt install -y libvolk-dev libspdlog-dev libgmp-dev libfmt-dev
```

---

## 2. Instalar PyBOMBS

```bash
sudo apt install -y python3-pip python3-venv pipx
```

```bash
pipx ensurepath
```

```bash
pipx install PyBOMBS
```

Depois desse ponto, feche e abra o terminal novamente.



---

## 3. Criar o prefixo limpo

Criar a pasta do prefixo:

```bash
mkdir prefix-3.10-clean
```

Inicializar o prefixo:

```bash
pybombs prefix init prefix-3.10-clean/ -a prefixclean
```

Configurar automaticamente:

```bash
pybombs -p prefixclean auto-config
```

Adicionar receitas padrão:

```bash
pybombs -p prefixclean recipes add-defaults
```

---

## 4. Instalar dependências complementares usadas antes do PyBOMBS

```bash
sudo apt install   libboost-system-dev   libboost-thread-dev   libboost-chrono-dev   libboost-program-options-dev   libboost-filesystem-dev   libboost-date-time-dev   libboost-serialization-dev
```

Dependências SDL usadas depois para o bloco Video SDL:

```bash
sudo apt install libsdl1.2-dev
```

```bash
sudo apt install libsdl2-dev (pode ser que não exista no repo, mas o pybombs instala automaticamente)
```

---

## 5. Instalar GNU Radio e UHD pelo PyBOMBS

```bash
pybombs -p prefixclean install gnuradio uhd
```

Se houver problema com versão do CMake, instale o CMake via `pip`:

```bash
pip install --user "cmake==3.31.6"
```


```bash
export PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH"
```

```bash
hash -r
```

Verificar a versão do CMake:

```bash
which cmake
```

```bash
cmake --version
```
deve retornar: cmake version 3.31.6


E rodar novamente:

```bash
pybombs -p prefixclean install gnuradio uhd
```

---

## 6. Carregar o ambiente do prefixo

Sempre antes de usar o GNU Radio desse ambiente, rode:

```bash
source prefix-3.10-clean/setup_env.sh
```

Definir o diretório de imagens UHD:

```bash
export UHD_IMAGES_DIR=/usr/share/uhd/images
```

Abrir o GNU Radio Companion:

```bash
gnuradio-companion
```
aqui você confere que o gnuradio está abrindo
---

## 7. Clonar o gr-tempest

Entrar na pasta `src` do prefixo:

```bash
cd prefix-3.10-clean/src/
```

Clonar o repositório:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/git-artes/gr-tempest.git
```

Entrar na pasta:

```bash
cd gr-tempest/
```

Criar e entrar na pasta de build:

```bash
mkdir build
```

```bash
cd build/
```

---

## 8. Compilar e instalar o gr-tempest



```bash
cmake .. -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/home/lucas/prefix-3.10-clean/ -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS="-std=c++11"
```

Compilar:

```bash
make
```

Instalar dentro do prefixo:

```bash
make install
```

Atualizar cache de bibliotecas:

```bash
sudo ldconfig
```

Abrir o GNU Radio Companion para validar:

```bash
gnuradio-companion
```

---

## 9. Habilitar/compilar o gr-video-sdl no GNU Radio

Entrar no build do GNU Radio:

```bash
cd ../../ (aqui você está voltando para a pasta raiz do prefixo)
```

```bash
cd src/gnuradio/
```

```bash
cd build/
```

Rodar o CMake habilitando o Video SDL:

```bash
cmake -DENABLE_GR_VIDEO_SDL=ON -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/home/lucas/prefix-3.10-clean/ ../
```

Instalar as dependências SDL que foram usadas:

```bash
sudo apt install libsdl1.2-dev
```

```bash
sudo apt install libsdl2-dev
```

Rodar novamente o CMake:

```bash
cmake -DENABLE_GR_VIDEO_SDL=ON -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/home/lucas/prefix-3.10-clean/ ../
```

Compilar:

```bash
make
```

Instalar:

```bash
make install
```

Abrir o GRC para validar:

```bash
gnuradio-companion
```

---

## 10. Corrigir os Missing Blocks do gr-tempest

Alguns exemplos do gr-tempest dependem de hier blocks. Os principais que apareceram como `Missing Block` foram:

- `Keep_1_in_N_Frames`
- `FFT_autocorrelation`
- `FFT_crosscorrelation`

Entrar na pasta de exemplos:

```bash
cd prefix-3.10-clean/src
```

```bash
cd gr-tempest/
```

```bash
cd examples/
```

Copiar os hier blocks para a pasta local usada pelo GRC:

```bash
cp Keep_1_in_N_frames.grc ~/.local/state/gnuradio/
```

```bash
cp FFT_autocorrelate.grc ~/.local/state/gnuradio/
```

```bash
cp FFT_crosscorrelate.grc ~/.local/state/gnuradio/
```

Abrir cada hier block e gerar com **F5** dentro do GNU Radio Companion:

```bash
gnuradio-companion ~/.local/state/gnuradio/Keep_1_in_N_frames.grc
```

```bash
gnuradio-companion ~/.local/state/gnuradio/FFT_autocorrelate.grc
```

```bash
gnuradio-companion ~/.local/state/gnuradio/FFT_crosscorrelate.grc
```

Depois abrir o GRC novamente:

```bash
gnuradio-companion
```

---

## 11. Validação esperada

Ao abrir o GNU Radio Companion, deve aparecer algo parecido com:

```text
<<< Welcome to GNU Radio Companion 3.10.12.0 >>>

Block paths:
    /home/lucas/.local/state/gnuradio
    /home/lucas/prefix-3.10-clean/share/gnuradio/grc/blocks
```

Se os `Missing Blocks` voltarem, confira se a pasta contém os arquivos gerados:

```bash
ls ~/.local/state/gnuradio
```

Devem existir arquivos relacionados a:

```text
Keep_1_in_N_frames.grc
Keep_1_in_N_Frames.py
Keep_1_in_N_Frames.block.yml
FFT_autocorrelate.grc
FFT_autocorrelation.py
FFT_autocorrelation.block.yml
FFT_crosscorrelate.grc
FFT_crosscorrelation_.py
FFT_crosscorrelation_.block.yml
```

